WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.368
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Change Settings: Wi-Fi, Sound and Wallpaper.

2
00:00:07.668 --> 00:00:12.816
Connect to Wi-Fi and personalise your computer. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.817 --> 00:00:16.817
Step one. Click Start, then Settings, the little gear.

4
00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:24.280
Step two. Open Network and internet, then Wi-Fi. Click your network name and type the password.

5
00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:30.005
Step three. Open System, then Sound. Move the slider to change the volume.

6
00:00:31.017 --> 00:00:37.724
Step four. Open Personalisation, then Background. Choose a picture you like for your wallpaper.

7
00:00:38.717 --> 00:00:42.507
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:42.807 --> 00:00:44.679
Connect to a Wi-Fi network.

9
00:00:44.979 --> 00:00:47.048
Set the volume to a comfortable level.

10
00:00:47.348 --> 00:00:48.651
Change your wallpaper.

11
00:00:48.951 --> 00:00:50.033
Well done!

